/go/digitalocean         https://www.digitalocean.com/try/free-trial-offer  302
/go/scraperapi           https://www.scraperapi.com/  302

/sitemap_index.xml       /sitemap.xml  301
/sitemaps.xml            /sitemap.xml  301
/sitemap-index.xml       /sitemap.xml  301

